&lt;h3 id=&#34;your-own-3d-parametric-modeler&#34;&gt;Your own 3D parametric modeler
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.freecad.org&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Website&lt;/a&gt; •
&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://wiki.freecad.org&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Documentation&lt;/a&gt; •
&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://forum.freecad.org/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Forum&lt;/a&gt; •
