    &gt;Git repository&lt;/a&gt; •
&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://blog.freecad.org&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Blog&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/freecad/freecad/releases/latest&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
