&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;overview&#34;&gt;Overview
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Freedom to build what you want&lt;/strong&gt;  FreeCAD is an open-source parametric 3D
modeler made primarily to design real-life objects of any size.
Parametric modeling allows you to easily modify your design by going back into
your model history to change its parameters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create 3D from 2D and back&lt;/strong&gt; FreeCAD lets you to sketch geometry constrained
2D shapes and use them as a base to build other objects.
It contains many components to adjust dimensions or extract design details from
3D models to create high quality production-ready drawings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Designed for your needs&lt;/strong&gt; FreeCAD is designed to fit a wide range of uses
including product design, mechanical engineering and architecture,
whether you are a hobbyist, programmer, experienced CAD user, student or teacher.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross platform&lt;/strong&gt; FreeCAD runs on Windows, macOS and Linux operating systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Underlying technology&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OpenCASCADE&lt;/strong&gt; A powerful geometry kernel, the most important component of FreeCAD&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coin3D library&lt;/strong&gt; Open Inventor-compliant 3D scene representation model&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Python&lt;/strong&gt; FreeCAD offers a broad Python API&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qt&lt;/strong&gt; Graphical user interface built with Qt&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;installing&#34;&gt;Installing
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Precompiled packages for stable releases are available for Windows, macOS and Linux on the
&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/releases&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Releases page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;On most Linux distributions, FreeCAD is also directly installable from the
software center application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For development releases visit the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD-Bundle/releases/tag/weekly-builds&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;weekly-builds page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Other options are described on the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://wiki.freecad.org/Download&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;wiki Download page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;compiling&#34;&gt;Compiling
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;FreeCAD requires several dependencies to correctly compile for development and
production builds. The following pages contain updated build instructions for
their respective platforms:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://wiki.freecad.org/Compile_on_Linux&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Linux&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://wiki.freecad.org/Compile_on_Windows&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Windows&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://wiki.freecad.org/Compile_on_MacOS&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;macOS&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://wiki.freecad.org/Compile_on_MinGW&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;MinGW&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;reporting-issues&#34;&gt;Reporting Issues
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;To report an issue please:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consider posting to the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://forum.freecad.org&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Forum&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://discord.com/invite/w2cTKGzccC&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Discord&lt;/a&gt; channel, or &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.reddit.com/r/FreeCAD&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Reddit&lt;/a&gt; to verify the issue;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Search the existing &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/issues&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;issues&lt;/a&gt; for potential duplicates;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use the most updated stable or &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD-Bundle/releases/tag/weekly-builds&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;development versions&lt;/a&gt; of FreeCAD;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Post version info from &lt;code&gt;Help &amp;gt; About FreeCAD &amp;gt; Copy to clipboard&lt;/code&gt;;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Restart FreeCAD in safe mode &lt;code&gt;Help &amp;gt; Restart in safe mode&lt;/code&gt; and try to reproduce the issue again. If the issue is resolved it can be fixed by deleting the FreeCAD config files.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Start recording a macro &lt;code&gt;Macro &amp;gt; Macro recording...&lt;/code&gt; and repeat all steps. Stop recording after the issue occurs and upload the saved macro or copy the macro code in the issue;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Post a Step-By-Step explanation on how to recreate the issue;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Upload an example file (FCStd as ZIP file) to demonstrate the problem;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more details see:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/issues&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Bug Tracker&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/issues/new/choose&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Reporting Issues and Requesting Features&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Contributing&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://forum.freecad.org/viewforum.php?f=3&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Help Forum&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://freecad.github.io/DevelopersHandbook/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Developers Handbook&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;[!NOTE]
The &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://fpa.freecad.org&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;FPA&lt;/a&gt; offers developers the opportunity
to apply for a grant to work on projects of their choosing. Check
&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://blog.freecad.org/jobs/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;jobs and funding&lt;/a&gt; to know more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;usage--getting-help&#34;&gt;Usage &amp;amp; Getting Help
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;The FreeCAD wiki contains documentation on
general FreeCAD usage, Python scripting, and development.
View these pages for more information:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://wiki.freecad.org/Getting_started&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Getting started&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://wiki.freecad.org/Feature_list&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Features list&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://wiki.freecad.org/FAQ/en&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Frequent questions&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://wiki.freecad.org/Workbenches&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Workbenches&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://wiki.freecad.org/Power_users_hub&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Scripting&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://wiki.freecad.org/Developer_hub&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Development&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://forum.freecad.org&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;FreeCAD forum&lt;/a&gt; is a great place
to find help and solve specific problems when learning to use FreeCAD.&lt;/p&gt;
